<title>USA: TABLE - Asahi/America Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Asahi/America Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MALDEN, Mass. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(dollars in thousands, except net income per share)</p>
<p>				   Three months	 Six months</p>
<p>					ended		  ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,	    June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net sales	     $10,133     $9,719    $19,256     19,371</p>
<p> Cost of sales	   6,359	6,047     12,120     12,352</p>
<p> Gross profit	    3,774	3,672	7,136	7,019</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>administrative expenses</p>
<p>			     2,635	2,595	5,326	4,961</p>
<p>Income from operations</p>
<p>			     1,139	1,077	1,810	2,058</p>
<p> Interest expense, net  (54)	 (84)	 (73)	(198)</p>
<p>Income before provision for</p>
<p>  income taxes	   1,085	  993	1,737	1,860</p>
<p>Provision for income taxes</p>
<p>				 456	  417	  729	  776</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>				 629	  576	1,008	1,084</p>
<p>Net income per common and</p>
<p>common equivalent share</p>
<p>				0.19	 0.20	 0.30	 0.42</p>
