<p>common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	3,340,000  2,881,387  3,340,281  2,610,694</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said higher revenues for the second quarter reflect strong sales in the general industries sector, particulary in chemical processing valves; revenues were slightly offset by lower sales in the semiconductor and military sectors.</p>
